  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Lang Ya blessed land, Lang Ya land spirit blurts the True Yang Building matter. The inkman Gu Immortal cuts in before the land spirit can introduce him and says he lives in Inkman City.",
      "chapters": [
        662
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_inkman_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inkmen hold a relatively favorable place among Northern Plains variant humans and keep a city with three inkman Gu Immortals. Mo Tan Sang is that city’s king, and under his leadership the inkmen resist pressure from many forces. He explains that Inkman City has long had close relations with Lang Ya blessed land, that his side has some qi path attainment, and that he came to help unseal a qi path seal on the land spirit. He also names Huang Jin tribe suppression of inkman city and Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s old demand that inkman cities offer countless female inkmen as tribute, then invites Fang Yuan to visit later.",
      "chapters": [
        662
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inkman-king",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_inkmen",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s prior-life memory rates him as hard to belittle: foresight, courage to act, and willingness to bow when needed. In that memory he expands inkman forces during the five regions war, takes a servant’s rite under Liu tribe for protection, then later leaves Liu when it weakens and collaborates with Ma Hong Yun on equal terms.",
      "chapters": [
        662
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inkman-king",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "char_ma_hong_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Early after the meeting, Tai Bai Yun Sheng recalls buying a cloud path defensive killer move from him, and Fang Yuan treats that sale as a favor priced below treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        670
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inkman-king",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a middle aged inkman Gu Immortal with a mighty disposition. His appearance is not that of a normal man: he has black skin and white hair.",
      "chapters": [
        661
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He appears quite dignified when he does not smile, and when he smiles he gives a feeling of great closeness.",
      "chapters": [
        1146
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demeanor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan takes Inkman City, Mo Tan Sang is still Inkman City Lord and king of the Northern Plains inkmen, a rank six Gu Immortal, and one of two remaining Gu Immortals of the city. Fang Yuan keeps him as Inkman City Lord, tells him to develop the city and nurture more inkman Gu Immortals, and Mo Tan Sang kneels and pledges to assist before entering the sovereign immortal aperture with the city into Mini Western Desert. He had earlier sold Tai Bai Yun Sheng the nine clouds ring mortal killer move as a favor when Fang Yuan was still rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        1766
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cultivation-and-office",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_western_desert"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later battle under Fang Yuan he fights as an inkman Gu Immortal and qi path cultivator, gathering and driving qi against enemy Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        2107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cultivation-and-office",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Still later inside the sovereign immortal aperture, his cultivation has advanced to rank seven. He has about eight Gu Immortals under him at rank six, and he is almost the person in charge of Mini Western Desert, governing Inkman City and many other locations.",
      "chapters": [
        2204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cultivation-and-office",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
